   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The station",
     "texto": [
      "**Платформа** (platform), **расписание** (timetable), **вагон** (carriage) and **проводник** (attendant who looks after a carriage and can check tickets). To ask the departure time: **Во сколько отправляется поезд?** (What time does the train leave?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Useful verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Отправляться** (to leave, depart) and **прибывать** (to arrive) are also used with trains. **Опаздывать** means to be late: **Поезд опаздывает** (the train is late). In **по расписанию** («according to the timetable»), **по** is followed by the dative: **расписанию**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
